{100}{}{Sinthia}
{200}{}{You see Sinthia, the seductive sellbaby.}
{210}{}{You see a pouty, shapely woman.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
