{3000}{}{Just get the hell out of my room!}
{3010}{}{[Done.]}
{4000}{}{You killed him! I can't believe you killed him. All he wanted was someone to talk to . .
.}
{4010}{}{He ain't dead. He's just gonna have a hurt head when he wakes up.}
{4020}{}{Hnnn.}
{5000}{}{Oh, sorry. I though he was dead. I though you killed him. He's not such a bad guy, after
all. Just a little lonely.}
{5010}{}{No problem.}
{6000}{}{Thank you for what you did. No one ever took care of me like that before.}
{6010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BigUpReact]}
{6020}{}{I can really take care of you later.}
{6030}{}{You're welcome.}
{6040}{}{Unh.}
{7000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'BigUpReact']}
{7010}{}{[Done.]}
{8000}{}{Is that all you can think about? Geez. Some people.}
{8010}{}{[Done.]}
{9000}{}{I mean, my boss didn't even send some of his goons to help. You'd think for all the cash
I make for that loser, he would at least live up to his part of the bargain.}
{9010}{}{Who's your boss?}
{9020}{}{What bargain?}
{10000}{}{Gizmo, of course. He runs all the sin in this town. Killian sure as hell wouldn't put up
with me or my kind. If it wasn't for the fact that I make Giz a whole hell of a lot of
money, I'd have to do other things to him.}
{10010}{}{Oh, baby, I understand. You gotta run home to momma. Well, come back here when you need
some luvin'!}
{11000}{}{And, honey, those thoughts just don't do my stomach a whole lot of good.}
{11010}{}{What else does Gizmo control?}
{11020}{}{You should just hang it up and move on with your life.}
{12000}{}{Just about every bad thing a person could do in this town. He owns the Casino. He runs
me and some of the other gals, even some little kids. I hear he is trying to take over
the bar.
---
Giz wants to take care of Killian, if you get my meaning.}
{12010}{}{[Done.]}
{13000}{}{You're telling me. But what else can I do? It seems like my life has been designed by
someone else. Oh, well. A girl has to make a living.}
{13010}{}{Oh, baby, I understand. You gotta run home to momma. Well, come back here when you need
some luvin'!}
{14000}{}{But sugar, this one's for free.
---
Thanks again, honey. We women gotta stick together.}
{14010}{}{Oh, baby, I understand. You gotta run home to momma. Well, come back here when you need
some luvin'!}
{15000}{}{Why, honey, I take care of men, and they take care of me in return. Gizmo gets 25% and I
supposedly get his protection. You saw how well that went, huh?"}
{15010}{}{What else does Gizmo control?}
{16000}{}{Thanks again.}
{16010}{}{[Done.]}
{17000}{}{Yeah, whatever. Get the hell out of my room!}
{17010}{}{[Done.]}
{18000}{}{Hey, darling, how you doing?}
{18010}{}{Okay. Bye.}
{18020}{}{Just fine, but I could be better.}
{18030}{}{Uhh.}
